{"title":"Magma Elemental","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 64 Fire Elemental that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>73</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental?lv=63\">Lv 63 <span>31</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>82</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental?lv=65\">Lv 65 <span>8</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>73</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental?lv=63\" title=\"Pick level 63\"><td><b>63</b></td><td>476</td><td>39.2</td><td>3,150</td><td class=\"muted\">1,428 · 54.9 · 9,450</td><td>31</td><td>in the wilds around 195, -1292</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental?lv=64\" title=\"Pick level 64\"><td><b>64</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>483</td><td>39.7</td><td>3,200</td><td class=\"muted\">1,449 · 55.6 · 9,600</td><td>82</td><td>in the wilds around 192, -1291</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental?lv=65\" title=\"Pick level 65\"><td><b>65</b></td><td>490</td><td>40.3</td><td>3,250</td><td class=\"muted\">1,470 · 56.4 · 9,750</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 4 recorded drops, 209 total, 41–59 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×41–59</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ember-core\" title=\"Ember Core - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7dea071d81fbeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 73</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6303\">Layout</button></li><li><b>The Keepers&#39; Drift</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 8</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-486\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2026.4px,756.6px)\"><i style=\"left:1996.7px;top:-769.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:2044.4px;top:-699.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:2066.5px;top:-710.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:2059.8px;top:-743.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1968.9px;top:-733.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:2066.2px;top:-759.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:2014.4px;top:-757.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:2017.1px;top:-727.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1986.6px;top:-756.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1989.6px;top:-771.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:2035.0px;top:-723.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:2032.0px;top:-738.9px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 186, -1288 <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 193, -1263 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 234, -1259 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"magma-elemental\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Fire Elemental: <a href=\"#/monster/dryback\">Dryback</a> <span class=\"muted\">(60)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cinderling\">Cinderling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart\">Emberfang&#39;s Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/molten-colossus\">Molten Colossus</a> <span class=\"muted\">(65)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cinder-heart\">Cinder Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(66)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/5a383e0f6a9951fdc283.svg\" alt=\"Magma Elemental\"></div><h3>Magma Elemental</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>60</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 64)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Fire Elemental</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>455</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>37.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,000</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2.7</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>25 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}